## 🗓️ Workshop Format (2 hours)

| Time | Activity | Output |
|------|----------|--------|
| Pre-work | Request the AI inventory and one completed impact assessment | Reality check before anyone speaks |
| 0:00–0:10 | Frame: the 74%/27% gap. Name the goal as calibration, not grading | Psychological safety to score honestly |
| 0:10–1:10 | Score D1–D8. **Evidence or it didn't happen** — for each claimed level, ask "show me" | Scored baseline with evidence references |
| 1:10–1:25 | Apply hard gates | List of deployments that should pause |
| 1:25–1:45 | Set target state per domain for 12 months (not all L5 — L5 is rarely the right target outside D2/D6) | Defensible target profile |
| 1:45–2:00 | Sequence: pick the two lowest-scoring weighted domains as Q1 focus | Roadmap with named owners |

**The one rule that makes this work:** no level is claimed without evidence anyone in the room can point to. Every maturity assessment that skips this produces a score 1.5 levels too generous, which is precisely the 47-point delta in the data above.

